STATES (every state renders — verified by ImageRenderer render-smoke + previews)
------------------------------------------------------------------------
  loading   → GlobalShortcutsLoading skeleton chrome (initial registry seed).
  content   → grouped cheatsheet (Actions/Navigation/Commands) — the web populated state.
  empty     → ContentUnavailableView "No keyboard shortcuts registered yet." (never a blank box).
  error     → inline error + Retry (web QueryError); retry re-seeds the registry.
  stale     → freshness chip + connectivity banner + ONE guarded auto-refresh (re-arms on return to live).
  offline   → offline chip + banner; keeps the cached cheatsheet, does NOT refetch.

